[2] │ &lt;b&gt;&lt;a&gt;n&lt;a&gt;n&lt;a&gt;





str_view(fruit, pattern = "[aeiou]")



[1] │ &lt;a&gt;ppl&lt;e&gt;
[2] │ b&lt;a&gt;n&lt;a&gt;n&lt;a&gt;

What is the distribution of majors in this course?
What proportion of students major in Stats?

